<p><span style="font-family:sans-serif; font-size:13.3333px">• </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif; font-size:13.3333px">Greatly simplify work processes with full payment automation through </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif; font-size:13.3333px"> software integration</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family:sans-serif; font-size:13.3333px">• </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif; font-size:13.3333px">Experience superior customer support and expertise provided by Thryft Advisors</span></p>
