ased on the </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">shipper’s existing rates, third party rates, or SHIPSTORE rates. </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">SHIPSTORE rates are based on the aggregate volume of our </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">existing customer base. We can provide a no</span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">-cost analysis to </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">identify potential savings, commonly in the range of 10</span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">-15%. </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">SHIPSTORE is a built to suit solution. Contact us today to explore </span><span style="font-family:sans-serif">the details of your individualized shipping solution.</span></span></p>
